blocks.en:
Let the double sequence $a_{ij}$ be such that $\sum_{i,j=1}^\infty|a_{ij}|^2<\infty$. Assume, moreover, that the matrix $a_{ij}$, $i,j=1,\ldots,N$, is positive definite for every $N$. Prove that the equation
\begin{equation}\label{eq:positive-double-sequence-l2-system-problem}
u_n+\sum_{j=1}^\infty a_{nj}u_j=f_n
\end{equation}
has a unique solution $u\in\ell^2$ for every $f\in\ell^2$.

blocks.zh:
设二重序列 $a_{ij}$ 满足 $\sum_{i,j=1}^\infty|a_{ij}|^2<\infty$. 再假设对每个 $N$, 矩阵 $a_{ij}$, $i,j=1,\ldots,N$, 均正定. 证明方程
\begin{equation}\label{eq:positive-double-sequence-l2-system-problem}
u_n+\sum_{j=1}^\infty a_{nj}u_j=f_n
\end{equation}
对每个 $f\in\ell^2$ 均有唯一解 $u\in\ell^2$.
